WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 8]

01:35.460 --> 01:36.980
Does Mr. Chen intend to retire?

01:41.460 --> 01:42.980
It's not just Chen Pingping.

01:44.460 --> 01:45.780
I wish to retire too.

01:46.820 --> 01:50.700
It's time to hand the Imperial Inspectorate
to youngsters like you all.

01:53.540 --> 01:55.220
Your retirement doesn't matter.

01:55.340 --> 01:57.340
However, Mr. Chen cannot retire.

01:58.340 --> 01:59.600
What are you saying?

01:59.620 --> 02:02.700
No one in the Imperial Inspectorate
is as important as Mr. Chen.

02:08.620 --> 02:09.980
Did you know

02:10.340 --> 02:12.140
that your trip to Northern Qi

02:12.340 --> 02:15.660
was actually part
of Chen Pingping's plan all along?

02:24.380 --> 02:25.600
To serve the state

02:25.620 --> 02:26.860
is my wish.

02:28.900 --> 02:31.580
He knew you would say that.

02:31.980 --> 02:33.820
Did he tell you to ask me this question?

02:34.900 --> 02:36.300
He has one more question.

02:37.340 --> 02:40.640
Will you obey all of his orders?

02:40.660 --> 02:41.740
Of course.

02:43.180 --> 02:44.740
What if his order

02:44.780 --> 02:47.020
is for you not to obey his order?

02:47.220 --> 02:50.580
What if he wants you to live
by following your heart?

02:52.780 --> 02:54.020
What does that mean?

02:58.340 --> 02:59.740
Come, help me up.

03:03.180 --> 03:05.960
You should interact
with Fan Xian more often.

03:05.980 --> 03:07.320
Is there a mission I need to accomplish?

03:07.340 --> 03:08.700
Make friends with him.

03:12.860 --> 03:14.580
Is that considered a mission as well?

03:16.620 --> 03:18.140
I want you to learn from him.

03:18.780 --> 03:22.140
Sometimes, you need to strike a balance
between your emotions and the law.

03:22.740 --> 03:25.140
You're inferior to him in that regard.

03:26.340 --> 03:27.740
How should I do so?

03:27.980 --> 03:29.900
These are
two different matters after all.

03:31.180 --> 03:35.460
It's just like how you brought
Shen Zhong's sister back to the Capital.

03:41.380 --> 03:42.980
That was me acting against orders.

03:43.300 --> 03:45.060
I'm willing to receive my punishment.

03:46.300 --> 03:48.340
We can ignore
whether it was an order or not.

03:48.380 --> 03:50.700
It doesn't matter
if you were right or wrong.

03:51.220 --> 03:52.480
When you did so,

03:52.500 --> 03:54.660
you were following your heart.

03:55.220 --> 03:57.740
How could one ignore
the right or wrong of an event?

03:59.780 --> 04:02.300
There's no rush.

04:03.100 --> 04:04.420
Let's head home first.

04:06.900 --> 04:10.900
I'll hand over the jobs
in the Fourth Division to you slowly.

04:11.220 --> 04:13.860
I've been working for many years.

04:14.620 --> 04:16.540
It's time for me to relax.

04:16.700 --> 04:17.780
All right.

04:18.380 --> 04:19.460
For your sake,

04:19.700 --> 04:22.220
I'll try my best
not to deceive the ruler in the future.

04:23.260 --> 04:24.340
Why don't I

04:24.380 --> 04:25.980
kick you out of the Yan family

04:26.020 --> 04:27.780
before I retire, then?

04:28.140 --> 04:29.540
Is that a mission as well?

04:31.500 --> 04:33.220
Just take your time.

04:42.820 --> 04:44.020
Mr. Yan?

04:45.140 --> 04:46.220
Come.

04:46.940 --> 04:47.920
You're actually here.

04:47.940 --> 04:49.020
Be careful.

04:49.180 --> 04:50.400
Mr. Chen instructed me to come.

04:50.420 --> 04:52.560
He wants me to help you
familiarize yourself with the place.

04:52.580 --> 04:53.660
Give me that.

04:55.060 --> 04:56.140
It's over there.

04:58.500 --> 04:59.800
Thank you.

04:59.820 --> 05:00.900
Thank you.

05:01.140 --> 05:02.040
Over here, please.

05:02.060 --> 05:03.420
Come, lend me a hand.

05:05.460 --> 05:06.980
It's pretty happening here.

05:07.260 --> 05:08.320
It's the First Division.

05:08.340 --> 05:10.900
They interact with the officials
in the Capital often.

05:11.946 --> 05:14.780
It became increasingly absurd
after Zhu Ge's death.

05:15.140 --> 05:16.660
Here. That's right.

05:16.940 --> 05:17.820
Take this inside.

05:17.820 --> 05:19.460
[Qing State Imperial Inspectorate
First Division Office]

05:19.460 --> 05:20.740
Be careful with that.

05:21.820 --> 05:22.800
Here. Leave it over there.

05:22.820 --> 05:23.980
Leave it there.

05:24.500 --> 05:26.120
Come on. Join us.

05:26.140 --> 05:27.120
Go by yourself.

05:27.140 --> 05:28.460
I'm too lazy to join you.

05:30.500 --> 05:32.020
There's a show later.

05:34.340 --> 05:35.860
It'll be a lively show.

05:38.086 --> 05:42.907
[Qing State Imperial Inspectorate
First Division Office]

05:55.380 --> 05:56.620
We entered the place just like that.

05:56.620 --> 05:58.420
No one even stopped to ask us questions.

06:07.140 --> 06:08.420
Yunmeng fish?

06:09.380 --> 06:10.180
Do you know what this is?

06:10.180 --> 06:12.000
It's a fish species
unique to the southern great lakes.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.480
It's famous for its sweet taste.

06:13.500 --> 06:16.020
Southern great lakes?
It's pretty far away.

06:16.060 --> 06:17.000
That's right.

06:17.020 --> 06:18.360
What about the ice?

06:18.380 --> 06:20.700
It was gathered from
the northern border last year.

06:21.340 --> 06:22.800
They kept it until now.

06:22.820 --> 06:24.060
[Urgent]
I guess it's for these fish.

06:24.060 --> 06:24.900
[Ministry of War]

06:24.900 --> 06:26.980
They were transported
to the Capital urgently.

06:27.200 --> 06:29.140
The fishes are from the South
while the ice is from the North.

06:29.140 --> 06:32.020
And, they were transported here urgently
just because they could try something new, huh?

06:32.020 --> 06:33.420
Who are you three?

06:33.780 --> 06:34.860
Wang?

06:35.340 --> 06:36.780
Zhu?

06:37.020 --> 06:37.920
Young Master Yan?

06:37.940 --> 06:39.100
Inspector.

06:39.580 --> 06:40.560
You actually know me?

06:40.580 --> 06:42.800
Inspector,
everyone here knows who you are.

06:42.820 --> 06:43.940
You're a busy man usually.

06:43.940 --> 06:45.560
What are you doing
in the First Division today?

06:45.580 --> 06:46.660
Zhu.

06:47.180 --> 06:49.440
Mr. Chen has a message.

06:49.460 --> 06:51.800
Mr. Fan will take over
the First Division temporarily

06:51.820 --> 06:54.660
as the inspector.

06:55.460 --> 06:56.800
That's great!

06:56.820 --> 06:58.120
I'll notify everyone immediately.

06:58.140 --> 06:59.620
I have a question for you.

07:00.340 --> 07:01.460
You're Zhu, right?

07:02.140 --> 07:03.300
Well,

07:03.700 --> 07:06.220
who delivered the Yunmeng fish here?

07:06.500 --> 07:07.560
I...

07:07.580 --> 07:09.360
I just came back from my errand.

07:09.380 --> 07:10.440
I'm not sure.

07:10.460 --> 07:11.480
All right.

07:11.500 --> 07:12.800
I'll go and ask someone else, then.

07:12.820 --> 07:13.440
Mr. Fan,

07:13.460 --> 07:14.820
I think I should notify the rest

07:14.820 --> 07:16.360
so that they can receive you.

07:16.380 --> 07:17.540
No need for that.

07:18.500 --> 07:20.220
I'll check out the place myself.

07:35.820 --> 07:36.900
One Dot.

07:37.900 --> 07:39.040
Six Character.

07:39.060 --> 07:40.140
Green Title.

07:41.380 --> 07:42.460
Six Dot.

07:46.380 --> 07:47.560
Two Dot.

07:47.580 --> 07:48.660
One Dot.

07:48.700 --> 07:49.860
Here.

07:50.060 --> 07:51.140
Southern Wind.

07:51.580 --> 07:52.380
Eight Bamboo.

07:52.380 --> 07:53.140
I need one more tile.

07:53.140 --> 07:54.220
Four Character.

07:57.460 --> 07:58.020
Hurry up...

07:58.020 --> 07:59.100
Green Title.

08:01.380 --> 08:02.540
It's your turn.

08:02.580 --> 08:03.920
He's going to Pong.

08:03.940 --> 08:05.020
Pong.

08:12.580 --> 08:13.780
Do you all know

08:13.900 --> 08:15.100
who I am?

08:16.260 --> 08:17.540
Keep it away!

08:23.180 --> 08:25.420
Not bad at all.
This place is pretty grand.

08:26.140 --> 08:28.340
Even the Mahjong tiles
are made out of amber.

08:29.140 --> 08:30.120
Mr. Fan,

08:30.140 --> 08:31.460
it's fake.

08:32.380 --> 08:33.520
You mean I'm a fake?

08:33.540 --> 08:34.780
No, Mr. Fan.

08:34.900 --> 08:35.880
It's made out of fake amber.

08:35.900 --> 08:37.540
It just resembles the real deal.

08:37.580 --> 08:38.840
Who gave the set to you all?

08:38.860 --> 08:39.660
The Imperial Treasury.

08:39.660 --> 08:42.000
They gave one set
to all eight divisions.

08:42.020 --> 08:42.600
Mr. Fan,

08:42.620 --> 08:44.240
we never play Mahjong

08:44.260 --> 08:45.640
when we have official duties.

08:45.660 --> 08:48.140
It's just that we've been free lately.

08:48.620 --> 08:49.780
Mr. Fan,

08:50.380 --> 08:51.660
please pardon us.

08:54.020 --> 08:55.740
What about the fish outside?

08:55.920 --> 08:57.140
Who gave them to you?

08:59.740 --> 09:01.740
What... What fish?

09:01.780 --> 09:04.420
Yunmeng fish. The one
that was transported here urgently.

09:04.780 --> 09:06.820
I'm not sure about that.

09:10.900 --> 09:12.300
Who's the one in charge here?

09:18.100 --> 09:19.420
You don't even know that?

09:21.500 --> 09:22.660
Mr. Fan,

09:23.100 --> 09:26.140
all of the supervisors
had applied for leave.

09:27.260 --> 09:28.620
Is none of them here?

09:29.620 --> 09:32.740
It's because we have
no official duties lately.

09:32.860 --> 09:34.080
How could that be?

09:34.100 --> 09:36.240
There are plenty of daily case files
and documents

09:36.260 --> 09:38.900
to be reviewed and archived
by the First Division.

09:39.660 --> 09:41.020
Who's in charge of that?

09:41.100 --> 09:42.760
The division chief clerk.

09:42.780 --> 09:45.660
He's in charge of
all miscellaneous matters.

09:45.980 --> 09:47.120
Where is he?

09:47.140 --> 09:48.120
He's in the side courtyard.

09:48.140 --> 09:49.400
I'll call for him right now.

09:49.420 --> 09:50.240
No need for that.

09:50.260 --> 09:51.780
I'll find him myself.

09:52.300 --> 09:53.500
As for the rest of you,

09:54.780 --> 09:55.940
continue the game.

09:56.060 --> 09:57.660
You should enjoy yourselves.

09:58.220 --> 09:58.820
Oh, right.

09:58.840 --> 10:00.240
Remember to distribute the fish outside

10:00.260 --> 10:02.420
when you're done playing.

10:02.500 --> 10:05.140
The fish will smell
if you keep them outside for too long.

10:14.540 --> 10:15.640
Don't move.

10:15.660 --> 10:17.840
Do you all actually
intend to continue your game?

10:20.660 --> 10:21.620
What should we do?

10:21.620 --> 10:23.420
I don't know either.

10:42.780 --> 10:44.020
Is anyone there?

10:50.540 --> 10:51.760
Qinian?

10:51.780 --> 10:52.900
Deng?

10:58.800 --> 11:00.840
I'm Deng Ziyue, Chief Clerk
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

11:00.860 --> 11:02.420
Greetings, Mr. Yan.

11:04.780 --> 11:05.860
Do you know him?

11:06.100 --> 11:07.420
He's my old acquaintance.

11:10.380 --> 11:11.660
Deng Ziyue?

11:11.860 --> 11:13.000
That's me.

11:13.020 --> 11:14.140
Do you know me?

11:15.020 --> 11:16.360
I've never seen you before.

11:16.380 --> 11:17.520
If so, why are you kneeling?

11:17.540 --> 11:18.760
Mr. Fan,

11:18.780 --> 11:20.760
everyone in the Imperial Inspectorate

11:20.780 --> 11:23.520
knows that Mr. Wang is your assistant.

11:23.540 --> 11:24.660
Besides,

11:24.780 --> 11:26.600
with your extraordinary bearing,

11:26.620 --> 11:28.280
your sword-like eyebrows
and starry eyes,

11:28.300 --> 11:29.620
and your imposing demeanor,

11:29.620 --> 11:31.080
I'd be truly blind

11:31.100 --> 11:32.820
if I didn't know who you are.

11:33.740 --> 11:34.880
Mr. Yan.

11:34.900 --> 11:36.060
Enough, Deng.

11:36.980 --> 11:41.020
Mr. Fan is temporarily
in charge of the First Division now.

11:41.100 --> 11:41.880
Really?

11:41.900 --> 11:43.020
Yes.

11:43.100 --> 11:44.180
My goodness.

11:44.500 --> 11:46.940
This is truly great news!

11:47.020 --> 11:47.840
Am I right?

11:47.860 --> 11:50.200
Mr. Fan, if you could
take over the First Division...

11:50.220 --> 11:52.000
If you take over the First Division,

11:52.020 --> 11:53.360
we'll have

11:53.380 --> 11:54.080
a core backbone

11:54.100 --> 11:56.720
in the division in the future.

11:56.740 --> 11:58.280
I feel as if

11:58.300 --> 12:00.360
a timely rain has descended
upon the drought I faced.

12:00.380 --> 12:02.000
It's as if I met a bosom friend
at a foreign place...

12:02.020 --> 12:02.880
Enough already.

12:02.900 --> 12:04.240
Stop licking my boots.

12:04.260 --> 12:05.500
He takes after you, huh?

12:05.820 --> 12:07.140
He's an old acquaintance.

12:08.100 --> 12:09.180
Deng Ziyue.

12:09.300 --> 12:10.360
Stand up and talk.

12:10.380 --> 12:11.600
Deng, get up.

12:11.620 --> 12:13.480
Thank you, Mr. Fan.

12:13.500 --> 12:17.140
Mr. Fan is different
from other officials.

12:19.980 --> 12:21.140
I have a question.

12:21.500 --> 12:23.900
Who delivered the Yunmeng fish here?

12:24.720 --> 12:27.440
[Deng Ziyue, Chief Clerk
of Imperial Inspectorate First Division]

12:28.620 --> 12:30.380
Don't tell me you have no idea either?

12:31.540 --> 12:32.780
Speak.

12:35.380 --> 12:36.540
Mr. Fan.

12:38.060 --> 12:41.420
It's delivered
by the Crop Inspection Bureau and Ministry of War.

12:41.500 --> 12:44.540
The Ministry of War
is actually involved?

12:45.320 --> 12:48.140
The Ministry of War is the only ministry capable
of transporting fresh Yunmeng fish

12:48.140 --> 12:51.020
back to the Capital urgently.

12:51.660 --> 12:52.980
What about the Crop Inspection Bureau?

12:52.980 --> 12:55.380
Fishes are usually sent
to the Crop Inspection Bureau first.

12:55.380 --> 12:57.360
The Crop Inspection Bureau
will grade them accordingly.

12:57.380 --> 12:59.260
After that, they'll be delivered
to the palace

12:59.260 --> 13:02.480
and the manors of the ministers
from the Six Ministries.

13:02.500 --> 13:07.060
Of course, the Crop Inspection Bureau
and Ministry of War will take out some

13:07.100 --> 13:09.020
and deliver them to the First Division.

13:10.620 --> 13:11.520
Have you eaten it?

13:11.540 --> 13:13.500
This kind of fish is extremely valuable.

13:15.300 --> 13:17.880
Thus, some of us ate it
while some sold it.

13:17.900 --> 13:19.060
Sold to where?

13:20.800 --> 13:22.260
The Crop Inspection Bureau.

13:26.500 --> 13:27.780
Excellent.

13:28.680 --> 13:30.500
The Crop Inspection Bureau
delivered the fish here.

13:30.500 --> 13:32.300
And now, you're selling it back to them.

13:33.140 --> 13:35.020
What a great deal.

13:35.900 --> 13:37.620
I'm sure the price was high as well.

13:40.420 --> 13:42.300
Maybe they just don't want

13:42.500 --> 13:44.060
to let it go to waste.

13:46.820 --> 13:49.380
If so, why did the Crop Inspection Bureau
and Ministry of War

13:49.420 --> 13:51.900
deliver such excellent fish to us?

13:55.740 --> 13:58.500
Just be honest with us.

14:00.780 --> 14:03.540
There's no one else here, right?

14:05.140 --> 14:06.220
No.

14:06.420 --> 14:08.020
You can tell us the truth, then.

14:14.020 --> 14:15.400
Mr. Fan,

14:15.420 --> 14:17.900
actually, it's not just
the Crop Inspection Bureau.

14:18.140 --> 14:21.060
All of the Six Ministries
do deliver gifts to us.

14:21.140 --> 14:22.620
Are we that popular?

14:23.420 --> 14:25.440
You see, this is the First Division.

14:25.460 --> 14:26.880
The duty of the First Division

14:26.900 --> 14:29.900
is to supervise the officials
in the Capital.

14:30.140 --> 14:32.200
Naturally, no one dares offend us.

14:32.220 --> 14:33.040
That's why

14:33.060 --> 14:35.420
they always allocate one share
of their profit to us.

14:35.500 --> 14:37.360
How dare you accept such gifts?

14:37.380 --> 14:38.940
That's not it. It's...

14:39.620 --> 14:40.940
The supervisor

14:41.220 --> 14:43.380
is accepting benefits
from the supervised, huh?

14:43.540 --> 14:45.020
That's utterly ridiculous.

14:45.860 --> 14:48.620
Mr. Yan, please be appeased!

14:50.500 --> 14:52.140
You see,

14:53.020 --> 14:55.280
it's unreasonable for us
not to accept their gifts either.

14:55.300 --> 14:58.540
That's why it's not that ridiculous
when you think about it.

14:59.660 --> 15:01.380
What do you mean by that?

15:01.420 --> 15:02.500
You see,

15:03.260 --> 15:04.480
as officials,

15:04.500 --> 15:05.580
all of them

15:05.740 --> 15:09.120
are living in the Capital.

15:09.140 --> 15:11.140
Sirs, I'm sure you all know

15:11.140 --> 15:14.140
that the relationships between officials
are complicated in the first place.

15:14.140 --> 15:15.560
And, they're intricate too.

15:15.580 --> 15:17.080
Forget about important affairs.

15:17.100 --> 15:18.660
There's no avoiding such relationships

15:18.660 --> 15:20.360
even for trivial affairs
like food, clothing,

15:20.380 --> 15:22.780
shelter, and daily expenses.

15:22.900 --> 15:24.900
If we don't accept the gifts,

15:25.780 --> 15:27.780
even if we don't want
to stoop to their level,

15:28.220 --> 15:29.620
it'll be difficult for us
to proceed with

15:29.620 --> 15:31.540
any tasks in the future.

15:33.500 --> 15:36.380
Mr. Deng, you do know
the pros and cons

15:36.620 --> 15:38.300
of being an official very well.

15:39.060 --> 15:40.600
First Division has plenty
of cases to handle.

15:40.620 --> 15:42.860
Have you been in charge
of handling them lately?

15:43.060 --> 15:44.660
I've always been in charge here.

15:46.780 --> 15:47.820
All right.

15:47.840 --> 15:49.400
Please continue to devote yourself

15:49.420 --> 15:50.980
to the First Division, then.

15:53.500 --> 15:55.600
Mr. Fan, I'm just the chief clerk.

15:55.620 --> 15:57.200
There are many supervisors above me.

15:57.220 --> 15:58.420
They're already gone.

16:03.900 --> 16:05.140
From today onward,

16:05.740 --> 16:07.420
Wang Qinian and Deng Ziyue

16:07.860 --> 16:11.120
will assist me in managing
the First Division.

16:11.140 --> 16:12.220
Mr. Fan,

16:12.500 --> 16:14.260
what about the rest
of the supervisors...

16:14.280 --> 16:15.280
Those who are not here today

16:15.300 --> 16:16.840
won't need to come back in the future.

16:16.860 --> 16:18.020
I'll notify the headquarters

16:18.020 --> 16:19.240
and send them somewhere else.

16:19.260 --> 16:20.620
Hurry!

16:20.900 --> 16:21.980
Quick!

16:22.860 --> 16:24.420
You all better look closely.

16:24.780 --> 16:26.880
I, Fan Xian,

16:26.900 --> 16:29.680
will take over the First Division
temporarily as the inspector.

16:30.500 --> 16:32.020
I'm not the main character here.

16:33.260 --> 16:34.900
This is our main character.

16:36.500 --> 16:37.900
This is Yan Bingyun.

16:38.540 --> 16:40.300
He just returned from Northern Qi.

16:40.420 --> 16:42.760
I'm sure you all know
how merciless and cruel

16:42.780 --> 16:44.240
he is.

16:44.260 --> 16:45.780
In other words,

16:45.900 --> 16:48.020
do you think he cares about
pride and dignity?

16:52.220 --> 16:53.400
Look at his eyes.

16:53.420 --> 16:55.220
They're filled with killing intent.

16:56.100 --> 16:57.760
Why do you think he's standing here?

16:57.780 --> 17:00.740
It's because he intends to
stick with me until the very end!

17:04.100 --> 17:05.760
A person like him

17:05.780 --> 17:07.860
is capable of anything.

17:10.260 --> 17:11.580
Do you all understand?

17:11.980 --> 17:12.660
We do.

17:12.660 --> 17:14.460
We do!

17:14.500 --> 17:15.440
We understand.

17:15.460 --> 17:16.860
I'll say this again.

17:17.220 --> 17:17.980
From today onward,

17:17.980 --> 17:20.160
all previous rules here are voided.

17:20.180 --> 17:21.100
Wang Qinian and Deng Ziyue

17:21.100 --> 17:22.680
will be my left-hand man
and right-hand man.

17:22.700 --> 17:23.860
Everyone,

17:24.020 --> 17:24.800
that's all from me.

17:24.820 --> 17:26.540
Any objections?

17:28.340 --> 17:31.940
Mr. Wang, Mr. Deng.

17:32.180 --> 17:33.760
You are being too courteous.

17:33.780 --> 17:36.940
In the future,
let's help each other out.

17:40.880 --> 17:41.860
You should be more courteous.

17:41.860 --> 17:42.960
They were addressing you, you know?

17:42.980 --> 17:44.060
Yes.

17:44.100 --> 17:45.400
Let's help each other out.

17:45.420 --> 17:48.860
I'll definitely do my best
and devote myself to my tasks.

17:50.260 --> 17:51.940
I have one more question.

17:52.580 --> 17:53.980
Do you all still remember

17:53.980 --> 17:56.380
the first sentence
of the vow you guys made

17:57.060 --> 17:58.780
when you first joined
the Imperial Inspectorate?

17:58.780 --> 18:01.760
All for the sake of the Qing State.

18:01.780 --> 18:03.240
But now,

18:03.260 --> 18:06.300
it's more like all for
the sake of your own lives.

18:07.780 --> 18:10.540
Did you all forget the vow you made?

18:14.020 --> 18:16.220
We didn't!

18:16.220 --> 18:17.780
What does the First Division do?

18:18.580 --> 18:20.500
What does the Imperial Inspectorate do?

18:21.300 --> 18:24.460
We seek clean governance
to ensure the people's peace!

18:24.660 --> 18:27.340
Did you all all forget about
the reason you joined us?

18:32.260 --> 18:33.940
I don't care what you did in the past.

18:33.940 --> 18:35.300
From today onward,

18:35.660 --> 18:37.020
do not do it again.

18:37.060 --> 18:39.380
All gifts are to be rejected!

18:39.500 --> 18:41.020
I know what you're trying to say.

18:41.180 --> 18:44.180
It's difficult to live in the Capital
without accepting gifts, right?

18:45.860 --> 18:48.960
No one has it easy in this world.

18:48.980 --> 18:51.200
Go to the streets!

18:51.220 --> 18:52.340
Just look at the people!

18:52.340 --> 18:53.940
Even they didn't say anything
about their lives!

18:53.940 --> 18:55.800
How dare you all
say something like that?

19:00.500 --> 19:01.820
But everyone, don't worry.

19:02.220 --> 19:03.700
I'm still

19:04.340 --> 19:06.100
easy to talk to.

19:06.460 --> 19:07.860
But you all must be careful.

19:09.420 --> 19:12.560
Do not let Yan get a hold of you
if you commit any mistakes.

19:12.580 --> 19:14.700
You'll experience living hell.

19:16.280 --> 19:17.780
The First Division
is out of my jurisdiction.

19:17.780 --> 19:20.800
All of us are in the Imperial Inspectorate.
All for the sake of the Qing State.

19:22.220 --> 19:24.080
All right. I'm done talking.

19:24.100 --> 19:25.240
Time to get to work.

19:25.260 --> 19:26.340
Deng Ziyue.

19:27.500 --> 19:30.540
Mr. Fan, what do you need?

19:31.580 --> 19:33.740
I saw the baskets of fish
in front of the entrance.

19:34.260 --> 19:35.980
I don't think they're fresh.

19:37.260 --> 19:39.460
The fish aren't fresh?

19:39.540 --> 19:40.860
The fish they gave us weren't fresh.

19:40.860 --> 19:42.260
What does that mean?

19:43.060 --> 19:44.966
That means the Crop Inspection Bureau

19:44.986 --> 19:46.720
looks down on the First Division.

19:46.740 --> 19:48.160
No one can stand that.

19:48.180 --> 19:48.840
Deng Ziyue.

19:48.860 --> 19:49.960
Yes, Mr. Fan.

19:49.980 --> 19:52.300
Take your men and seal off
the Crop Inspection Bureau.

19:52.700 --> 19:53.400
Mr. Fan!

19:53.420 --> 19:54.280
Mr. Fan...

19:54.300 --> 19:55.800
Mr. Fan! Here's the thing.

19:55.820 --> 19:58.760
Eunuch Dai of the Crop Inspection Bureau
is Consort Shu's favorite subject.

19:58.780 --> 20:00.220
I know. It's Second Prince's mother.

20:00.220 --> 20:01.560
She loves to read. I met her before.

20:01.580 --> 20:03.540
If so, Mr. Fan, shouldn't you
reconsider your decision?

20:03.540 --> 20:04.720
There's nothing to be afraid of.

20:04.740 --> 20:06.460
Listen to me and seal it off.

20:06.580 --> 20:07.660
Even if you wish to do so,

20:07.660 --> 20:09.100
what kind of charges
should we put on them?

20:09.100 --> 20:10.700
Of all the cases
that the First Division has handled,

20:10.700 --> 20:13.180
don't tell me the Crop Inspection Bureau
didn't commit any mistakes at all?

20:13.200 --> 20:15.260
When you put it that way,
I guess they did commit some mistakes.

20:15.260 --> 20:16.260
What are you waiting for, then?

20:16.260 --> 20:17.320
Take your men and seal it off.

20:17.340 --> 20:18.080
Well... Mr. Fan...

20:18.100 --> 20:20.500
I'm new to the division. It's already
hard enough for me to win their support.

20:20.500 --> 20:23.460
And, my position isn't high enough
to deal with the Crop Inspection Bureau.

20:23.820 --> 20:26.340
If so, Mr. Yan, why don't you
do it on his behalf?

20:26.360 --> 20:28.260
It's the First Division's task.
What has it got to do with me?

20:28.260 --> 20:30.720
All of us are in the Imperial Inspectorate.
We serve the state.

20:30.740 --> 20:32.780
If so, Mr. Yan, sorry for the trouble.

20:33.060 --> 20:35.640
You want me to take my men
to seal off the Crop Inspection Bureau?

20:35.660 --> 20:37.020
What will you do, then?

20:38.020 --> 20:39.440
I'll invite the audience.

20:39.460 --> 20:40.580
The stage is set.

20:40.580 --> 20:42.500
We have to get some audience.

20:43.540 --> 20:44.860
Who are you inviting?

20:46.020 --> 20:47.780
The greatest showman!

20:50.020 --> 20:50.980
Fan Xian, you're here.

20:50.980 --> 20:51.780
Be careful.

20:51.780 --> 20:52.860
Watch your step.

20:54.100 --> 20:55.780
Quickdraw, you're back too?

21:00.780 --> 21:04.380
I always complained
that he was cold and impolite.

21:04.500 --> 21:06.080
Your Highness, he's no match for you.

21:06.100 --> 21:07.480
I have to criticize you.

21:07.500 --> 21:08.880
It's been so long since you came back.

21:08.900 --> 21:10.520
But this is your first time visiting me.

21:10.540 --> 21:12.700
Yes. It's my fault indeed.

21:12.740 --> 21:13.820
That's why

21:14.100 --> 21:15.540
I'm visiting you personally.

21:17.860 --> 21:19.380
This is my gift of apology.

21:19.980 --> 21:21.240
What is this?

21:21.260 --> 21:23.060
Have you ever heard of Yunmeng fish?

21:23.980 --> 21:25.240
Yunmeng fish?

21:25.260 --> 21:26.760
It's renowned
for its sweet and fresh taste.

21:26.780 --> 21:28.280
We have to drink first.

21:28.300 --> 21:29.480
I'll tell my men

21:29.500 --> 21:32.540
to steam them. Where's the fish?

21:38.460 --> 21:40.000
I searched the entire city.

21:40.020 --> 21:41.220
I couldn't find any.

21:43.860 --> 21:45.240
I appreciate your effort.

21:45.260 --> 21:46.480
You delivered a bucket of water to me.

21:46.500 --> 21:48.080
But it's the thought that counts.

21:48.100 --> 21:49.180
Is that so?

21:51.460 --> 21:52.540
Here you go.

21:57.260 --> 21:58.340
Bi'an.

21:59.900 --> 22:01.180
Clean the place up.

22:02.820 --> 22:04.400
But I know where we can get some fish.

22:04.420 --> 22:05.520
So?

22:05.540 --> 22:07.080
Let's go and catch some fish.

22:07.100 --> 22:08.960
You want me to come
and catch fish with you?

22:08.980 --> 22:10.440
Your Highness, are you busy?

22:11.660 --> 22:13.060
I knew it.

22:13.220 --> 22:15.620
The most interesting person
in the entire Capital

22:16.460 --> 22:17.480
must be you.

22:17.500 --> 22:18.860
I feel the same.

22:43.260 --> 22:45.540
I told you all before.

22:46.100 --> 22:49.740
You may ignore all of
the other offices in the Capital.

22:50.780 --> 22:54.260
However, you must serve
the Imperial Inspectorate well.

22:57.300 --> 22:58.860
Did I not say that before?

22:59.060 --> 23:00.500
Did I not say that before?

23:00.500 --> 23:01.920
You did!

23:01.940 --> 23:04.080
Eunuch Dai, we dare not
take them lightly.

23:04.100 --> 23:06.200
We didn't skimp on bribing them.

23:06.220 --> 23:09.280
We even delivered
some Yunmeng fish to them today.

23:09.300 --> 23:12.300
If so, why did the First Division
come and seal our place off?

23:13.020 --> 23:14.980
We have no idea either.

23:15.820 --> 23:17.280
Which supervisor was it?

23:17.300 --> 23:18.480
None of them was here.

23:18.500 --> 23:20.560
I think their leader's surname is Deng.

23:20.580 --> 23:22.060
He's a chief clerk.

23:28.660 --> 23:30.300
Get up!

23:41.060 --> 23:44.060
What kind of charges did they use?

23:44.180 --> 23:46.720
Charges like skimming money
off the food budget and such.

23:46.740 --> 23:48.780
How is that even a charge?

23:50.060 --> 23:52.180
He must be here to sponge off us.

23:54.180 --> 23:57.460
Sir, why don't you go and check on him?

23:57.860 --> 24:00.780
He's just a chief clerk.
He doesn't deserve my attention.

24:02.460 --> 24:04.000
The Imperial Inspectorate

24:04.020 --> 24:06.580
might be influential in the Capital,

24:06.980 --> 24:09.180
but who gave them
their authority and power?

24:09.500 --> 24:11.540
It's the palace.

24:12.420 --> 24:14.760
If you don't go,
our bureau will remain sealed off.

24:14.780 --> 24:16.460
What should we do, then?

24:23.820 --> 24:26.620
They can seal it off
for as long as they like.

24:27.300 --> 24:30.380
Later, tell the Imperial Kitchen

24:30.780 --> 24:34.220
that there are fewer vegetables
delivered to the palace.

24:34.860 --> 24:38.780
Especially the vegetables
that the consorts love.

24:39.020 --> 24:40.780
Tell them they're out of stock.

24:44.020 --> 24:45.440
That won't do.

24:45.460 --> 24:48.520
If the higher-ups ask you about it,

24:48.540 --> 24:52.220
tell them that the First Division
was too mighty.

24:52.500 --> 24:54.780
They cut off
the palace's vegetable supply.

24:55.100 --> 24:58.460
The Crop Inspection Bureau is too lowly

24:58.460 --> 25:00.160
to resist them.

25:00.180 --> 25:03.980
Should we reduce His Majesty's
vegetable supply as well?

25:05.540 --> 25:07.680
How long has it been
since you joined the palace?

25:07.700 --> 25:10.100
How dare you say something like that?

25:10.460 --> 25:11.780
I know my fault now.

25:19.540 --> 25:21.040
Eunuch Dai.

25:21.060 --> 25:21.840
[Eunuch Dai]
What now?

25:21.841 --> 25:23.720
[Head Officer of Crop Inspection Bureau]
What now?

25:23.740 --> 25:25.160
[Hong Zhu, Eunuch]
Mr. Fan Xian

25:25.180 --> 25:27.380
has rushed
to the Crop Inspection Bureau.

25:28.580 --> 25:30.380
Come forward and speak.

25:34.780 --> 25:36.440
Mr. Fan Xian

25:36.460 --> 25:38.740
has rushed
to the Crop Inspection Bureau.

25:40.060 --> 25:42.540
How did we provoke Fan Xian?

25:43.260 --> 25:45.400
Eunuch Dai knows what to do.

25:45.420 --> 25:46.540
You may leave.

25:47.100 --> 25:48.860
Sir, you should go there.

25:50.060 --> 25:50.960
Such audacity!

25:50.980 --> 25:52.980
Who are you
to tell Eunuch Dai what to do?

25:52.980 --> 25:54.260
Wait!

25:54.420 --> 25:56.000
Why should I go?

25:56.020 --> 25:57.240
Sir,

25:57.260 --> 26:00.040
Fan Xian isn't the only person
who rushed to the Crop Inspection Bureau.

26:00.060 --> 26:01.620
Second Prince is there as well.

26:03.780 --> 26:04.920
Who did you say?

26:04.940 --> 26:06.260
Second Prince.

26:07.060 --> 26:08.280
Sir, don't panic.

26:08.300 --> 26:10.020
I asked them about it.

26:10.300 --> 26:11.960
Although Second Prince was there,

26:11.980 --> 26:13.280
he was only observing the situation.

26:13.300 --> 26:14.720
It didn't seem like he was angry.

26:14.740 --> 26:16.540
I don't think it's a big deal.

26:22.020 --> 26:23.300
I'm glad to hear that.

26:24.740 --> 26:26.520
The Crop Inspection Bureau

26:26.540 --> 26:28.160
depends on Consort Shu solely.

26:28.180 --> 26:29.720
Since Second Prince is there,

26:29.740 --> 26:31.220
sir, you should be there.

26:31.220 --> 26:33.860
We mustn't let His Highness
think that we're taking him lightly.

26:39.100 --> 26:40.820
He has a point.

26:41.460 --> 26:42.580
I have to go.

26:51.420 --> 26:52.800
What's your name again?

26:52.820 --> 26:54.920
Eunuch Dai, my name is Hong Zhu.

26:54.940 --> 26:56.200
Are you new to the palace?

26:56.220 --> 26:58.000
I'm in the palace for a few years now.

26:58.020 --> 26:59.260
Good.

27:00.660 --> 27:02.500
You're pretty witty.

27:04.860 --> 27:06.740
All of you should learn from him.

27:07.020 --> 27:08.100
Yes, sir.

27:23.780 --> 27:25.080
You will come with me.

27:25.100 --> 27:27.700
Sir, I won't be joining you.

27:27.940 --> 27:29.060
Such audacity!

27:29.100 --> 27:30.920
How dare you resist Eunuch Dai's order?

27:30.940 --> 27:32.300
Go away!

27:40.020 --> 27:41.760
Why are you resisting my order?

27:41.780 --> 27:43.360
Someone has to stay in the palace

27:43.380 --> 27:45.820
so that we can deal with the situation
if they manage to find faults

27:45.840 --> 27:47.000
with the Crop Inspection Bureau.

27:47.020 --> 27:48.000
How?

27:48.020 --> 27:50.620
Naturally, I'll seek out
Consort Shu and plead to her.

27:54.860 --> 27:56.060
You should stay here.

27:56.420 --> 27:57.820
Sir, don't worry.

27:59.500 --> 28:01.180
All of you, stay here.

28:01.540 --> 28:02.620
Yes, sir.

28:08.260 --> 28:09.540
Eunuch Hong!

28:13.220 --> 28:16.200
I need your opinion on something.

28:16.220 --> 28:17.520
Seniors, all of you are present.

28:17.540 --> 28:19.160
I dare not give my opinion.

28:19.180 --> 28:20.400
But please ask away.

28:20.420 --> 28:23.100
Should we reduce
the Imperial Kitchen's vegetable supply?

28:26.980 --> 28:29.040
Since Eunuch Dai has rushed over there,

28:29.060 --> 28:30.780
maybe we still stand a chance.

28:30.820 --> 28:35.440
At this moment,
the less trouble we cause,

28:35.460 --> 28:37.260
the higher the chance of our survival.

28:37.660 --> 28:39.340
Eunuch Hong, you have a point.

28:39.820 --> 28:40.840
Don't try anything stupid.

28:40.860 --> 28:42.080
Now, we just need

28:42.100 --> 28:42.720
to wait.

28:42.740 --> 28:44.260
Yes, you're right.

29:11.980 --> 29:13.060
Deng.

29:13.980 --> 29:15.620
Go and see if he's here.

29:15.740 --> 29:16.820
Yes, sir.

29:42.940 --> 29:43.800
Mr. Wang.

29:43.820 --> 29:44.580
Please wait.

29:44.580 --> 29:46.020
[Warehouse]

29:46.020 --> 29:46.840
I can't afford to be late.

29:46.860 --> 29:48.040
They're waiting for me inside.

29:48.060 --> 29:48.860
You're right.

29:48.860 --> 29:50.860
- What are you doing?
- Please wait.

29:52.100 --> 29:53.240
Mr. Wang,

29:53.260 --> 29:55.640
I've long heard
that you were both wise and mighty.

29:55.660 --> 29:58.500
It's a shame that
I had no chance to meet you in person.

30:01.100 --> 30:02.260
What are you doing?

30:06.100 --> 30:08.760
Mr. Wang, I heard

30:08.780 --> 30:11.220
that you're Mr. Fan's
favorite subordinate.

30:11.340 --> 30:14.180
So, what result does Mr. Fan wish to get

30:15.340 --> 30:18.220
out of this situation?

30:19.460 --> 30:23.340
Eunuch Dai, you deliver fish
to the First Division periodically.

30:25.060 --> 30:26.700
We're still

30:27.460 --> 30:28.760
on good terms.

30:28.780 --> 30:30.460
It was nothing noteworthy.

30:30.540 --> 30:33.100
However, Mr. Fan

30:33.100 --> 30:35.040
didn't get to taste
the fish you delivered.

30:35.060 --> 30:37.560
It's because Mr. Fan just arrived
at the First Division not long ago.

30:37.580 --> 30:40.340
Don't worry.
I've prepared something for him.

30:41.660 --> 30:43.180
All right. Let's go inside.

30:43.580 --> 30:44.960
Hold on.

30:44.980 --> 30:46.820
There's one more thing.

30:47.060 --> 30:48.300
There's one more thing.

30:49.460 --> 30:51.540
What is Second Prince
doing here as well?

30:53.980 --> 30:56.620
You have another question?

31:01.820 --> 31:03.160
Since Second Prince is here,

31:03.180 --> 31:04.920
it makes things easier for us,

31:04.940 --> 31:05.640
am I right?

31:05.660 --> 31:08.540
After all, we're officials
in the Capital.

31:08.700 --> 31:10.020
No matter what we do,

31:10.260 --> 31:12.300
we need to follow the rules.

31:12.740 --> 31:14.620
Understood.

31:15.540 --> 31:16.740
Let's go. Please.

31:18.580 --> 31:21.160
Mr. Fan instructed me to come out
and see if the person has arrived.

31:21.180 --> 31:22.300
I'm here.

31:30.380 --> 31:32.060
You'll get a share since you saw it.

31:33.820 --> 31:35.340
Let's share our profits

31:35.780 --> 31:37.020
together.

31:52.020 --> 31:55.220
Greetings, Your Highness.

31:56.700 --> 31:57.780
You may rise.

31:59.260 --> 32:00.580
Thank you, Your Highness.

32:01.260 --> 32:03.300
I heard that you have Yunmeng fish here.

32:03.860 --> 32:04.560
That's right.

32:04.580 --> 32:06.100
I'm here to buy some of them.

32:06.500 --> 32:08.220
Your Highness, you must be joking.

32:08.260 --> 32:10.720
I'll tell my men to deliver them
to your residence later.

32:10.740 --> 32:12.000
This is an official task.

32:12.020 --> 32:13.540
You have to accept my payment.

32:14.020 --> 32:16.240
As a prince, I cannot abuse my power.

32:16.260 --> 32:18.820
You understand that, right?

32:19.020 --> 32:20.820
Yes, Your Highness.

32:21.020 --> 32:22.860
I was inconsiderate.

32:23.100 --> 32:24.180
Bi'an,

32:24.260 --> 32:25.340
pay him.

32:25.460 --> 32:26.540
No need for that.

32:30.340 --> 32:32.060
Your Highness, it's my treat.

32:33.260 --> 32:33.760
Wait...

32:33.780 --> 32:34.860
I'll pay for it.

32:36.540 --> 32:37.180
Wait, this is...

32:37.180 --> 32:38.660
Record this transaction.

32:39.980 --> 32:41.000
I'll record it later.

32:41.020 --> 32:42.000
Don't wait any longer.

32:42.020 --> 32:43.240
We have papers and a brush here.

32:43.260 --> 32:44.380
Record it now.

32:44.820 --> 32:45.900
All right.

32:48.860 --> 32:49.940
All right.

32:51.460 --> 32:52.820
Don't use this book.

32:52.840 --> 32:53.580
Use this one instead.

32:53.580 --> 32:55.320
[Crop Inspection Bureau Ledger No. 337]

33:03.020 --> 33:05.860
Eunuch Dai, do you know Jin?

33:07.260 --> 33:08.280
Who?

33:08.300 --> 33:09.000
Jin.

33:09.020 --> 33:10.000
A vegetable seller.

33:10.020 --> 33:11.380
He owed you a huge debt.

33:12.500 --> 33:14.380
I think so.

33:15.860 --> 33:17.940
- You don't remember him, huh?
- Yes.

33:23.260 --> 33:25.480
Mr. Fan, if Jin is related to you,

33:25.500 --> 33:27.480
I can call off his debt.

33:27.500 --> 33:28.240
No need for that.

33:28.260 --> 33:29.240
Everything's fine now.

33:29.260 --> 33:30.620
I'm glad to hear that.

33:33.920 --> 33:36.260
[Two Top-Grade Yunmeng Fish, Fan Xian]
Eunuch Dai, your handwriting is nice.

33:36.260 --> 33:37.460
You flatter me.

33:40.780 --> 33:43.580
It looks just like the handwriting
in this ledger.

33:43.820 --> 33:46.580
So, Eunuch Dai, you record
all the transactions yourself, huh?

33:46.880 --> 33:48.760
I'm indebted to His Majesty
for this position.

33:48.780 --> 33:50.340
I dare not take my job lightly.

33:51.220 --> 33:53.420
If so, I guess I have to ask you

33:53.420 --> 33:54.740
if I find any issues here.

33:56.460 --> 33:58.940
The Crop Inspection Bureau

33:59.180 --> 34:01.160
deals with trivial affairs
for the palace.

34:01.180 --> 34:03.380
The accounts are a bit fragmented.

34:03.420 --> 34:04.860
Mr. Fan, I can explain it to you

34:04.880 --> 34:06.300
if you don't understand it.

34:06.420 --> 34:07.500
Fragmented?

34:12.580 --> 34:14.580
Not at all.

34:15.340 --> 34:17.740
It's a huge deal.

34:22.060 --> 34:24.060
The Crop Inspection Bureau
only purchases groceries.

34:24.060 --> 34:25.860
How is this a huge deal?

34:28.140 --> 34:28.960
Eunuch Dai,

34:28.980 --> 34:30.060
the rise and fall of the state

34:30.060 --> 34:32.340
are related to eunuchs like you all
as well, am I right?

34:34.460 --> 34:35.400
I guess so.

34:35.420 --> 34:37.660
The Qing State just engaged
Northern Qi in a huge battle.

34:37.660 --> 34:39.760
And, our border army was mighty enough
to achieve a huge victory.

34:39.780 --> 34:42.380
Don't you think your bureau
should show them some appreciation?

34:44.100 --> 34:46.160
The food supply of the border army

34:46.180 --> 34:48.100
is not within our jurisdiction.

34:48.340 --> 34:49.780
Remember, it's a huge deal.

34:49.860 --> 34:51.320
Look at the bigger picture.

34:51.340 --> 34:52.920
What do you mean?

34:52.940 --> 34:54.780
Is the Crop Inspection Bureau
part of the Qing State?

34:54.780 --> 34:55.440
Yes, it is.

34:55.460 --> 34:58.080
If so, shouldn't you all bask
in the glory of their victory as well?

34:58.100 --> 34:58.800
Yes.

34:58.820 --> 35:01.160
We've spent a lot of money
in the battle against Northern Qi, right?

35:01.180 --> 35:01.800
Yes.

35:01.820 --> 35:03.040
Now that the battle is over,

35:03.060 --> 35:04.620
the imperial court lacks money.

35:04.780 --> 35:06.220
Does that make sense?

35:06.340 --> 35:07.160
Yes, it does.

35:07.180 --> 35:09.260
If so, as the people of Qing State,
shouldn't we share their woes?

35:09.260 --> 35:09.700
We should.

35:09.700 --> 35:11.140
Should the Crop Inspection Bureau
be responsible, then?

35:11.140 --> 35:12.220
We should.

35:14.260 --> 35:16.620
But what should we be responsible for?

35:20.820 --> 35:22.780
The Imperial Treasury is empty.

35:23.180 --> 35:25.300
The entire state lacks money.

35:25.340 --> 35:28.440
Not only did the Crop Inspection Bureau
not try to resolve that issue,

35:28.460 --> 35:30.340
but you all also embezzled funds
using other methods.

35:30.340 --> 35:31.280
Is that even appropriate?

35:31.300 --> 35:33.920
No! That's not true!

35:33.940 --> 35:35.960
I'm an honest person.

35:35.980 --> 35:37.720
I even feel terrible
when I look at money.

35:37.740 --> 35:39.840
Mr. Fan, I'm sure you misunderstood me.

35:39.860 --> 35:41.140
You're an honest person?

35:43.140 --> 35:44.860
We're from the Imperial Inspectorate.

35:45.180 --> 35:46.240
You've heard of it, right?

35:46.260 --> 35:47.280
Definitely.

35:47.300 --> 35:48.420
I assume you know a little

35:48.420 --> 35:50.300
about the way we do things as well.

35:50.380 --> 35:52.760
You know clearly whether or not
you've embezzled the state fund.

35:52.780 --> 35:54.500
You know the consequences

35:55.060 --> 35:56.780
if we continue checking your ledgers.

36:02.220 --> 36:04.620
Eunuch Dai, the state lacks money.

36:05.800 --> 36:07.360
Can't the Crop Inspection Bureau

36:07.380 --> 36:09.300
do their part

36:09.340 --> 36:11.060
and share our woes with us?

36:21.060 --> 36:24.980
Mr. Fan, may we speak in private?

36:25.700 --> 36:27.900
It's fine. There are no outsiders here.

36:29.060 --> 36:30.660
Yes, there are no outsiders here.

36:40.780 --> 36:42.400
Regarding the ledgers,

36:42.420 --> 36:44.160
here are some additional details.

36:44.180 --> 36:45.280
If you don't understand it,

36:45.300 --> 36:47.060
you may head back and read it yourself.

36:55.380 --> 36:58.620
1,000, 2,000,

36:59.780 --> 37:01.220
3,000 taels.

37:05.620 --> 37:07.420
3,000 taels?

37:07.700 --> 37:08.940
I guess that's enough.

37:10.580 --> 37:11.260
Speaking of which,

37:11.260 --> 37:14.420
purchasing groceries
is quite difficult too, am I right?

37:16.220 --> 37:18.120
It's my duty.

37:18.140 --> 37:19.840
Since all of us are fellow officials,

37:19.860 --> 37:21.560
I shouldn't be too overbearing.

37:21.580 --> 37:23.180
I should be kind to everyone, right?

37:23.260 --> 37:24.340
That's right.

37:24.780 --> 37:28.380
Mr. Fan, you truly understand
the way of the officialdom.

37:29.860 --> 37:32.640
Does that mean the Crop Inspection Bureau
wasn't at fault here?

37:32.660 --> 37:33.760
Was I being too abrupt?

37:33.780 --> 37:35.300
That's not it!

37:35.340 --> 37:37.280
It's your duty to check the ledgers.

37:37.300 --> 37:39.340
Everything's fine as long as
the misunderstanding is resolved.

37:39.340 --> 37:40.420
Deng.

37:41.540 --> 37:42.620
Let's go.

37:44.340 --> 37:45.420
Let's go!

37:53.780 --> 37:54.760
The show is over.

37:54.780 --> 37:56.220
Let's head home.

38:00.260 --> 38:02.500
You better don't forget
about His Highness' fish.

38:02.620 --> 38:04.840
I'll surely deliver it
to His Highness's residence.

38:04.860 --> 38:06.860
Your Highness, do you
need my men to escort you back?

38:06.880 --> 38:08.360
No need for that. See you again.

38:08.380 --> 38:09.460
Okay.

38:10.860 --> 38:11.940
We have to see each other again.

38:11.940 --> 38:13.140
I'll wait for you.

38:35.780 --> 38:38.180
This is the debt I incurred
six months ago.

38:38.180 --> 38:39.260
Thank you for remembering it.

38:39.260 --> 38:41.380
It's my duty to repay it.

38:41.860 --> 38:43.180
The fruits are fresh today.
You should buy some.

38:43.180 --> 38:44.040
Sure.

38:44.060 --> 38:45.260
Please pick them.

38:45.900 --> 38:47.300
This is more ripe.

38:48.260 --> 38:48.940
Please go ahead.

38:48.940 --> 38:50.260
This is more ripe.

38:50.540 --> 38:51.560
I'll take these.

38:51.580 --> 38:53.500
Did you know what you were doing?

38:55.820 --> 38:56.980
I was taking bribes.

38:57.900 --> 38:59.140
I'll definitely

38:59.420 --> 39:00.860
complain about you.

39:01.100 --> 39:02.160
You alone aren't enough.

39:02.180 --> 39:04.060
Get a few more people to join you.

39:04.380 --> 39:06.060
What nonsense are you talking about?

39:08.780 --> 39:09.900
Mr. Fan, have a pear.

39:12.380 --> 39:13.240
Do you want one?

39:13.260 --> 39:14.340
No.

39:18.740 --> 39:20.460
So, which bureau is in charge

39:20.820 --> 39:22.300
of impeachment?

39:24.900 --> 39:26.820
It's either the Imperial Inspectorate

39:27.260 --> 39:28.980
or the Imperial Procuratorate.

39:30.780 --> 39:32.260
The Imperial Procuratorate?

39:33.780 --> 39:35.300
The censors, huh?

39:35.780 --> 39:37.300
How is it? Are you close to them?

39:38.380 --> 39:39.840
What exactly are you up to?

39:39.860 --> 39:40.920
Didn't I tell you already?

39:40.940 --> 39:42.600
Get a few more people to join you
in impeaching me.

39:42.600 --> 39:43.760
Sorry for the trouble.

39:43.780 --> 39:45.580
Please spread this news for me.

39:47.380 --> 39:48.920
People lay traps

39:48.940 --> 39:50.580
for their political opponents.

39:50.620 --> 39:51.700
But you?

39:51.720 --> 39:53.420
You're digging a grave for yourself.

39:53.660 --> 39:54.840
Please.

39:54.860 --> 39:56.780
No one will save you
if you get in trouble.

40:08.340 --> 40:09.240
Deliver this,

40:09.260 --> 40:10.367
the ledger,

40:10.387 --> 40:13.747
and the transaction records to Mr. Chen.

40:14.220 --> 40:15.300
Yes, Mr. Fan.

40:16.260 --> 40:17.420
And this as well.

40:17.540 --> 40:18.440
Just as you predicted.

40:18.460 --> 40:19.780
Eunuch Dai gave me this.

40:22.420 --> 40:23.640
Record all of it.

40:23.660 --> 40:24.740
Yes, Mr. Fan.

40:28.520 --> 40:31.582
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

40:36.900 --> 40:39.780
Eunuch Dai never knew who Jin was.

40:42.420 --> 40:44.100
No one remembers him.

41:58.660 --> 42:00.860
Actually, I'd only met him
for a few times.

42:01.380 --> 42:02.820
But for some reason,

42:03.260 --> 42:04.660
I cannot forget him.

42:09.100 --> 42:10.180
Wang,

42:11.140 --> 42:12.793
if no one stands up for them,

42:12.813 --> 42:14.773
people like them

42:15.660 --> 42:18.340
can only suffer in silence
for the rest of their lives.

42:21.540 --> 42:23.420
But who can stand up for them?

42:23.780 --> 42:25.180
[Baoyue Pleasure House]
Who can show them

42:25.180 --> 42:27.420
what law truly means?

42:28.580 --> 42:31.420
If no one can see the law,

42:32.180 --> 42:33.740
who will believe in it?

42:36.060 --> 42:37.140
Say,

42:38.480 --> 42:40.100
am I being too sentimental here?

42:42.100 --> 42:43.180
Mr. Fan,

42:44.180 --> 42:45.780
I wish to witness

42:45.820 --> 42:48.180
the legendary law in action as well.

42:52.420 --> 42:56.060
If so, we shall broaden
the horizons of the Capital.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
